heretic-ascension-ert-enroute = An occult threat has been confirmed aboard the station. An inquisitor response team is en route to contain the threat and protect the crew's evacuation.
heretic-ascension-evacuation = An occult entity has ascended aboard the station. Begin evacuation. The emergency shuttle will arrive in { $time } { $units }.
heretic-inquisitor-ert-name = ERT inquisitor
heretic-inquisitor-ert-description = Contain the ascended heretic and their servants. Protect survivors and secure the crew's evacuation. Follow Central Command orders.
